id: c-arte-respects-ARTE_TRUTH_DIR-env-var
role: control
subset: subset
title: Arte respects ARTE_TRUTH_DIR env var
serves: m-env-var-reader
note: ARTE_TRUTH_DIR, ARTE_RUNS_DIR, ARTE_DISPATCH_PATH env vars redirect artefact to read/write from those paths instead of the CWD defaults. Fallback to current `.truth/`, `qa/runs/`, `.loop-dispatch` when unset.
status: ok
